     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "More or less than what",
     "texto": [
      "**Più di quanto** (more than what), **meno di quanto** (less than what): **Costa più di quanto credevo** (it costs more than I believed).",
      "With «previsto» you use **del**: **più del previsto** (more than expected)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "As... as",
     "texto": [
      "**Tanto... quanto** (as... as), **non tanto... quanto** (not as... as): **Tanto bello quanto caro** (as beautiful as it is expensive).",
      "And **come previsto** (as expected)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
